*> Test of 29b part 8 section 6, Method of the residual sweep (core/src/growth-29b-8*.cob; T0675): the sweep counts, the hook names and the status names.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-GROWTH-29B-8-6.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY INTERACT.
 01 WS-ISG.
    05 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I9 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I10 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I11 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I12 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I13 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I14 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I15 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-IST REDEFINES WS-ISG.
    05 WS-I BINARY-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-FXSG.
    05 WS-FX1 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX2 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX3 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX4 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX5 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX6 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX7 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX8 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX9 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX10 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX11 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX12 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX13 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX14 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX15 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX16 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-FXST REDEFINES WS-FXSG.
    05 WS-FX FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-RSG.
    05 WS-R1 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R2 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R3 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R4 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R5 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R6 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R7 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R8 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R9 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R10 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R11 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R12 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R13 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R14 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R15 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RST REDEFINES WS-RSG.
    05 WS-R BINARY-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-RFSG.
    05 WS-RF1 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF2 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF3 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF4 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF5 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF6 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF7 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF8 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-RFST REDEFINES WS-RFSG.
    05 WS-RF FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 8 TIMES.
 01 WS-IN                  PIC X(160).
 01 WS-TOK                 PIC X(24).
 01 WS-P                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SHOW                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-TEXTS.
    05 WS-T1               PIC X(96).
    05 WS-T2               PIC X(96).
 01 WS-DOC                PIC X(64).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§6 Method of the residual sweep: sweep numbers (6, validation 11): 330 top-level classes in 410 class files of which 80 are inner classes, 105 classes declare a hook, 3 hook" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "4" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "5" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "330 410 80 105 3" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§6 Method of the residual sweep: the counts agree: top-level classes + inner classes = class files (330 + 80 = 410)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-SWEEP-NUM" USING WS-I1 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "330 80" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§6 Method of the residual sweep: hook names (6 step 1): tick, randomTick, neighborChanged" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-HOOK-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-HOOK-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-HOOK-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "4" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-HOOK-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "tick| randomTick| neighborChanged| |" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§6 Method of the residual sweep: status names (6 step 3): Covered, Partial, Unclaimed, and a Covered or Partial row" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-STATUS-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-STATUS-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-STATUS-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "4" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-STATUS-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "5" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-STATUS-NAME" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "Covered| Partial| Unclaimed| Covered / Partial| |" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.

 BEGIN-CASE.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     .

 LOAD-IN.
     MOVE 1 TO WS-P
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 16
         MOVE SPACES TO WS-TOK
         IF WS-P <= 160
             UNSTRING WS-IN DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE INTO WS-TOK WITH POINTER WS-P
         END-IF
         COMPUTE WS-FX(WS-K) = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK)
         COMPUTE WS-I(WS-K) = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK)
     END-PERFORM
     .

 ADD-N.
     PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > WS-N
         MOVE WS-R(WS-J) TO WS-SHOW
         IF WS-J > 1
             STRING "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOW) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-PERFORM
     STRING " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     .

 ADD-TEXT.
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-T1) "|" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-T2) " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     .
 END PROGRAM TEST-GROWTH-29B-8-6.
